# The sdist holds the module, pyproject.toml, README.md and LICENSE. The tests need the
# repository around them (integrations/testdata, tools/fake_wearable.py), so they stay out,
# and so do the examples, which are in the repository and the kit.
# .github/scripts/check_python_dist.py fails the build on any other file.
prune tests
prune examples
